EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh, someone new! You must have
just moved to {{TAG:0005:0006:}} today!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Still unpacking, right?
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}I know. It's SO much work. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}I moved
here two weeks ago. I heard this
town is a great place to live.
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Wait! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}You didn't just move here?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
You've lived here for a while?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
And your name is {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}YOU'RE {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Everyone here said you're so great,
but then I never saw you around.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I thought you were avoiding me!
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}You didn't even know I moved to
town, did you? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}I'm sorry. I just
assumed you.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
Well, never mind. Let's start over.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Hello, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}I'm {{TAG:0005:0001:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
And I hope we'll be best friends!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Just come visit more often, OK?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ah, {{TAG:000E:0006:1E0075006E0020006E0075006F0076006F00200076006900630069006E006F00200075006E00610020006E0075006F0076006100200076006900630069006E006100}}! Devi esserti
